00:58:25.180 --> 00:58:32.270
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program provided by Mr. Torey Malatia, who does not understand why we have so many women on our staff.

00:58:32.270 --> 00:58:34.850
<v Shant Kenderian>Do they do the same work as men?

00:58:34.850 --> 00:58:51.750
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories on This American Life.

00:58:51.750 --> 00:58:56.750
